      "type": "section",
      "text": "Insurance Quotation > Insurance Service Provider\n\nAccess to the Insurance Quotation APIs requires TPPs to hold the ISP role. The API Hub validates the role on every request before proxying to your Ozone Connect endpoints. Unlike Insurance Data Sharing, there is no per-customer consent — TPPs authenticate with the Client Credentials Grant and act as themselves.",
